.TH bhtune-template-delete 1  "bhtune-template-delete "
.SH NAME
bhtune\-template\-delete \- Delete a template. Refuses if any saved loop still references it. A `Builtin`\- or `Catalog`\-origin template reappears automatically the next time bhtune starts unless it\*(Aqs also removed from its source (bhtune\-core\*(Aqs embedded catalog for `Builtin`, which only a new bhtune release can change; the user catalog file for `Catalog`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-template\-delete\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a template. Refuses if any saved loop still references it. A `Builtin`\- or `Catalog`\-origin template reappears automatically the next time bhtune starts unless it\*(Aqs also removed from its source (bhtune\-core\*(Aqs embedded catalog for `Builtin`, which only a new bhtune release can change; the user catalog file for `Catalog`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

